NOTE: the lengths of the 0.750" o.d. sections have
been reduced by the  lengths of the 2.405" o.d.
sections which simulate mounting plates, which are 
4" x 4" x 0.250" aluminum plates. These heavy-duty
elements will withstand 125 mph winds.

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1, with a mid-band free-
space gain of 11.6 dBi.
